      "raw_text": "```python\nfraggap=Int('fraggap')\nskb_prev=Int('skb_prev')\ns.add(Or(fraggap == 0, fraggap != 0))\ns.add(skb_prev == 0)\n```",
      "raw_sha256": "beff74bf8da49808fb5577082e033e25a93e957dc73fa51a800253364ac99cd3",
      "provenance_scope": "caller-bound response; hash is not an independent semantic attestation"
